 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nSchwarzwald Medizintechnik AG                    MASTER SERVICES\nBerliner Allee 19, 50667 Köln, Germany          AGREEMENT\nUSt-IdNr: DE601658937\n\nVON                                              RECHNUNGSADRESSE\n\nSchwarzwald Medizintechnik AG                    Müller Industrietechnik GmbH\nBerliner Allee 19                                Berliner Allee 19\n50667 Köln                                       50667 Köln\nGermany                                          Germany\nVAT: DE601658937\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 28.03.2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and\nbetween Schwarzwald Medizintechnik AG, with its registered office at Berliner Allee 19, Köln (\"Party A\"), and Müller\nIndustrietechnik GmbH, with its registered office at Berliner Allee 19, Köln (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 36 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in\naccordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the\npurposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by Swedish law.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A    Schwarzwald Medizintechnik AG / Jürgen Hoffmann\nParty B    Müller Industrietechnik GmbH / Jürgen Hoffmann\nDate       28.03.2026",
